<title>USA: InterAmericas Q1 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>InterAmericas Q1 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.06     loss	 $0.05</p>
<p> Net loss		   1,047     loss	   613</p>
<p> Revs			   568			 54</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said Q1 1997 net loss widened due to increased investment costs related to infrastructure development.</p>
<p>The company said it raised $3.5 million in Q1 1997 to finance its Santiago network in Chile and to continue construction on its fiber optics network in Lima, Peru.</p>
<p>Full name is InterAmericas Communications Corp.</p>
</text>
